<template><section class="canonical-desk x-overview"><nav class="research-tabs" aria-label="來源資料"><a href="?workspace=signals&sourceTab=posts" :aria-current="tab==='posts'?'page':undefined" @click.prevent="setTab('posts')">X 原文</a><a href="?workspace=signals&sourceTab=consensus" :aria-current="tab==='consensus'?'page':undefined" @click.prevent="setTab('consensus')">共識與分歧</a><a href="?workspace=signals&sourceTab=disclosures" :aria-current="tab==='disclosures'?'page':undefined" @click.prevent="setTab('disclosures')">交易揭露</a><a href="?workspace=signals&sourceTab=health" :aria-current="tab==='health'?'page':undefined" @click.prevent="setTab('health')">更新狀況</a><a href="?workspace=signals&sourceTab=prices" :aria-current="tab==='prices'?'page':undefined" @click.prevent="setTab('prices')">歷史行情</a></nav><p v-if="error" class="canonical-alert" role="alert">{{ error }} <button @click="load">重試來源摘要</button></p><template v-if="extra && tab!=='posts'"><p class="muted">固定快照：{{ extra.metadata.as_of_utc }} · 重新載入不會抓取新資料。</p><template v-if="tab==='consensus'"><h2>共識與分歧</h2><p>觀察窗口 {{ extra.consensus.window_start_utc }} 至 {{ extra.consensus.as_of_utc }}，共 {{ extra.consensus.window_hours }} 小時。</p><p>此窗口共同看多 {{ extra.consensus.shared_bullish.length }}、共同看空 {{ extra.consensus.shared_bearish.length }}、分歧 {{ extra.consensus.split.length }}。沒有達成共識，不代表看法中立。</p><h3>語氣共識</h3><p v-if="!extra.consensus.tone_signals.length">此窗口沒有符合條件的語氣共識。</p><article v-for="r in extra.consensus.tone_signals" :key="r.ticker" class="source-card"><a :href="postsUrl(r.ticker)">{{ r.ticker }} · 查看語氣來源</a><p>{{ r.tone || r.direction || '語氣分類見原文' }}</p></article><details><summary>共識如何形成</summary><p>只計啟用且有投票資格的帳號，排除置頂貼文。同帳號對同標的同時看多與看空列為混合；至少兩個只看多帳號，且沒有看空或混合，才列共同看多。共同看空反向相同；多空並存或任何混合列分歧。語氣獨立呈現，不增加多空票。</p></details><div v-for="group in consensusGroups" :key="group.label"><h3>{{ group.label }}</h3><p v-if="!group.rows.length">此窗口沒有符合項目。</p><article v-for="r in group.rows" :key="r.ticker" class="source-card"><a :href="postsUrl(r.ticker)">{{ r.ticker }} · 查看相關原文</a><p>看多：{{ r.bulls?.join('、') || '無' }}；看空：{{ r.bears?.join('、') || '無' }}；混合：{{ r.mixed?.join('、') || '無' }}</p></article></div></template><template v-if="tab==='disclosures'"><h2>公開交易揭露</h2><p>從既有 X 原文抽取的事件；這些是他人公開揭露的線索，不會寫入你的私人帳本。交易日期與揭露日期分開，未核實者仍需回原始申報。</p><label class="company-search">搜尋揭露<input type="search" v-model="search" placeholder="標的、交易者…" @input="page=0"/></label><p>{{ disclosureRows.length }} 個去重事件 · 每頁 25 個</p><p v-if="!disclosurePage.length" class="empty-state">此搜尋或頁碼沒有揭露。<button @click="search='';page=0">返回全部揭露</button></p><article v-for="(r,i) in disclosurePage" :key="r.trader_key+r.ticker+r.t+i" class="source-card"><h3>{{ r.who }} · {{ r.ticker }} · {{ direction(r.direction) }}</h3><p>整理交易日期（待核實）：{{ r.trade_date || '原文未明確提供' }} · 揭露日期：{{ r.disclosed_at }} · {{ r.amount || '金額未明確提供' }}</p><p v-if="r.trade_date_text" class="muted">原文時間說法：{{ r.trade_date_text }}</p><p class="muted">{{ r.reports }} 則同事件來源，已合併；整理日期不是獨立申報核實。</p><a v-for="url in r.urls" :key="url" :href="url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="artifact-button">開啟揭露原文 ↗</a></article><div class="button-row"><button :disabled="page===0" @click="page--">上一頁揭露</button><span>第 {{ page+1 }} 頁</span><button :disabled="(page+1)*25>=disclosureRows.length" @click="page++">下一頁揭露</button></div><details><summary>交易者與保存的行情代理權重</summary><p>這些權重是舊系統保存的分類先驗與行情代理評分，並非已核實的實際交易績效或推薦。沒有重抓行情、重算或使用權重產生買賣建議。</p><label>搜尋交易者<input type="search" v-model="traderSearch"/></label><div class="table-scroll"><table class="ledger-table"><thead><tr><th>交易者</th><th>類別</th><th>先驗權重</th><th>已評事件 / 總事件</th><th>保存權重 / 計算日期</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="t in filteredTraders" :key="t.trader_key"><th>{{ t.display_name }}</th><td>{{ t.category }}</td><td>{{ t.prior_weight }}</td><td>{{ scores[t.trader_key]?.n_scored ?? '未評' }} / {{ scores[t.trader_key]?.n_events ?? '未登錄' }}</td><td>{{ scores[t.trader_key]?.weight ?? '未評' }} / {{ scores[t.trader_key]?.computed_at?.slice(0,10) || '未登錄' }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details></template><template v-if="tab==='health'"><h2>資料更新狀況</h2><p>原文 {{ Object.keys(extra.post_facts_by_id).length.toLocaleString() }} 則，最新股票關聯 {{ Object.keys(extra.signal_details_by_id).length.toLocaleString() }} 筆。窗口內尚待分類的意見貼文：{{ extra.health.pending_opinion_posts_in_window }}。</p><p>下表是匯出時保存的抓取收據。失敗表示該次抓取未成功，既有原文仍保留；網站無法代替 Mac 登入或啟動排程。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table class="ledger-table"><thead><tr><th>帳號</th><th>最近抓取</th><th>狀態</th><th>取得貼文</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="r in extra.health.latest_fetch_per_registered_account" :key="r.handle"><th>@{{ r.handle }}</th><td>{{ r.started_at_utc }}</td><td>{{ r.status==='failed'?'失敗':r.status==='success'?'成功':r.status }}</td><td>{{ r.tweets }}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>帳號與投票資格</summary><ul><li v-for="a in extra.accounts" :key="a.handle">@{{ a.handle }} · {{ a.enabled?'啟用':'停用' }} · {{ a.counts_toward_consensus?'參與共識':'不參與共識' }}</li></ul></details><h3>更新流程</h3><p>Mac 既有排程抓取、分類與保存資料，再由匯出程序產生來源快照；主站部署新版後讀取新快照。原 DB、爬取程式與排程保留。主站與舊站都沒有網站自動同步。</p></template><template v-if="tab==='prices'"><h2>歷史行情</h2><p class="muted">既有行情快照與代理報酬；不連動你的持倉估值。</p><PriceHistory /></template></template><p v-else-if="tab!=='posts'&&!error">正在載入來源摘要…</p></section></template>
<script setup>
import {computed,onMounted,onUnmounted,ref,watch} from 'vue'
import {xSupplement} from './api.js'
import PriceHistory from './PriceHistory.vue'
const emit=defineEmits(['change'])
const extra=ref(null),error=ref(''),tab=ref(new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('sourceTab')||'posts'),search=ref(new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('disclosureQ')||''),traderSearch=ref(''),page=ref(Math.max(0,Math.min(1000,Number(new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('disclosurePage'))||0)))
const consensusGroups=computed(()=>[{label:'共同看多',rows:extra.value.consensus.shared_bullish},{label:'共同看空',rows:extra.value.consensus.shared_bearish},{label:'分歧',rows:extra.value.consensus.split},{label:'其餘被提及標的',rows:extra.value.consensus.mentioned}])
const disclosureRows=computed(()=>extra.value.disclosure_timeline.filter(r=>(r.who+' '+r.ticker).toLowerCase().includes(search.value.toLowerCase())))
const disclosurePage=computed(()=>disclosureRows.value.slice(page.value*25,(page.value+1)*25))
const scores=computed(()=>Object.fromEntries(extra.value.trader_scores.map(s=>[s.trader_key,s])))
const filteredTraders=computed(()=>extra.value.traders.filter(t=>t.display_name.toLowerCase().includes(traderSearch.value.toLowerCase())))
const postsUrl=ticker=>'?workspace=signals&q='+encodeURIComponent(ticker.split(':').at(-1))
const direction=v=>({buy:'買入揭露',sell:'賣出揭露',cover:'回補空單揭露'}[v]||v)
watch([search,page],()=>{if(tab.value!=='disclosures')return;const p=new URLSearchParams(location.search);p.set('disclosureQ',search.value);p.set('disclosurePage',page.value);history.replaceState(null,'','?'+p)})
function pop(){const p=new URLSearchParams(location.search);search.value=p.get('disclosureQ')||'';page.value=Math.max(0,Math.min(1000,Number(p.get('disclosurePage'))||0));tab.value=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('sourceTab')||'posts';if(!['posts','consensus','disclosures','health','prices'].includes(tab.value))tab.value='posts';emit('change',tab.value)}
function setTab(id){const p=new URLSearchParams(location.search);p.set('workspace','signals');p.set('sourceTab',id);history.pushState(null,'','?'+p);window.dispatchEvent(new PopStateEvent('popstate'))}
async function load(){error.value='';try{extra.value=await xSupplement()}catch(e){error.value=e.message}}
onMounted(()=>{load();pop();window.addEventListener('popstate',pop)});onUnmounted(()=>window.removeEventListener('popstate',pop))
</script>
